 <section className="admin-settings-section"><div className="admin-settings-icon"><Search size={20}/></div><div className="admin-form-heading"><div><span className="eyebrow">01 / HOMEPAGE SEARCH RESULT</span><h3>Homepage SEO</h3><p>These details appear in search results when search engines index your homepage.</p></div></div><div className="admin-settings-grid"><label className="admin-field-wide">Homepage meta title<input maxLength="70" value={form.homepageSeoTitle||''} onChange={e=>setForm(f=>({...f,homepageSeoTitle:e.target.value}))} placeholder="SMART OUTFIT | Your Style, Our Inspiration"/></label><small className="admin-field-wide">{titleLength}/70 characters · Keep the title clear and descriptive.</small><label className="admin-field-wide">Homepage meta description<textarea rows="3" maxLength="180" value={form.homepageSeoDescription||''} onChange={e=>setForm(f=>({...f,homepageSeoDescription:e.target.value}))} placeholder="Describe your store in a concise sentence."/></label><small className="admin-field-wide">{descriptionLength}/180 characters · A concise description can help search visitors understand the page.</small><label className="admin-field-wide">Meta keywords<input maxLength="300" value={form.homepageSeoKeywords||''} onChange={e=>setForm(f=>({...f,homepageSeoKeywords:e.target.value}))} placeholder="fashion, clothing, online shopping"/></label></div></section>
